        <p style="color:#475569;">Feature-level keyword analysis (what consumers mention)</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;">Price perception data (value for money signals)</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;">Preference ranking by demographic (state, age, gender)</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;">Switching intent signals (would reviewer switch to your product?)</p>
      </div>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">Use Cases</h2>
